sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Field worker
    participant HP as Home / background service
    participant SS as SyncService
    participant OP as OpLog (Isar)
    participant FR as FaceAuthEventRemoteRepository
    participant AW as AuthenticatedPageWrapper
    participant WR as WorkerRegistryService
    participant GW as DIGIT Gateway
    participant BE as health-attendance /<br/>worker registry

    rect rgb(240,248,255)
    Note over U,BE: 7.1 — FaceAuthEvent audit events (oplog path)
    U->>HP: Sync Data (or background timer)
    HP->>SS: performSync (SyncLock acquired)
    SS->>OP: getPendingUpSync(createdBy = user)
    OP-->>SS: pendingUp = {faceAuthEvent}
    SS->>FR: bulkCreate(events)
    FR->>GW: POST /health-attendance/face-auth/v1/bulk/_create
    GW->>BE: authorized (service-registry entry §5.2)
    BE-->>FR: HTTP 202 (async persister)
    SS->>OP: markSyncedUp
    end

    rect rgb(245,255,245)
    Note over AW,BE: 7.2 — worker-registry retry drain (offline enrollments)
    AW->>AW: mount / offline→online transition
    AW->>WR: for each queued individualId
    WR->>GW: POST /worker/v1/_search
    WR->>GW: POST /worker/v1/bulk/_update (embedding payload)
    alt role mapped in access control (§5.3)
        GW->>BE: update worker additionalDetails
        BE-->>WR: success → dequeue
    else mapping missing
        GW-->>WR: HTTP 401 → stays queued
    end
    end
